# Imprint / legal notice shown in the footer of the landing page.
# The value is rendered as Markdown. Use \n for newlines.
# In Docker/CI, pass as build-arg IMPRINT_MD (GitHub secret: IMPRINT_MD).
# Locally, set VITE_IMPRINT_MD directly in .env.local.
# Optional — a generic placeholder is shown when unset.

# VITE_IMPRINT_MD="## Imprint\n\nYour Name\nYour Address\n\nEmail: [you@example.com](mailto:you@example.com)"
